# Effects of connecting sequences of building blocks on reticular synthesis of covalent organic frameworks

De-Li Ma1,2, Cheng Qian1,2 $\left(\boxtimes\right)$ , Qiao-Yan $\mathsf{Q i}^{2}$ , Zhong-Ri Zhong1, Guo-Fang Jiang1 $\langle\boxtimes\rangle$ ), and Xin Zhao2 ()
